Ported from textarea
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Parts of textarea-cli are Go translations of the textarea web app's
JavaScript, so that both write the same files and links. The web app is
Lucas Van De Weerd's fork of Anton Medvedev's textarea. The share link format
(compressed text in the address's #fragment) comes from Anton Medvedev's
original. The note file format and file names, word counts, password links,
the export formats, the search grammar and the folder sync plan come from the
fork (lib/front-matter.js, lib/filename.js, lib/stats.js, lib/share.js,
lib/formats.js, lib/export.js, lib/filter.js, lib/folder-sync.js).

