Ideas, no code
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
These projects inspired parts of the design. Nothing was copied from them.

- tw93/Mole (GPL-3.0): the numbered option menu that `text` opens, with
  a letter or a digit to jump to a row.
- jrnl-org/jrnl (GPL-3.0) and iridakos/stup (MIT): one note per day that
  `text today …` adds timestamped lines to.
- antoniorodr/memo (Apache-2.0): reaching Apple Notes by scripting Notes.app
  from the terminal, inside a folder of its own.
